msgid "Tutorials and resources"
msgstr "教學與資源"

msgid ""
"This is a list of third-party tutorials and resources created by the Godot "
"community. For resources, remember that there is the official `Godot Asset "
"Store <https://store.godotengine.org/>`_ full of official and community "
"resources too!"
msgstr ""
"本清單收錄了由 Godot 社區建立的第三方教學與資源。如需取得更多資源，請記得存取"
"官方 `Godot Asset Store <https://store.godotengine.org/>`_ ，那裡還匯集了大量"
"官方及社區提供的資源！"

msgid ""
"Think there is something missing here? Feel free to submit a `pull request "
"<https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/blob/master/community/"
"tutorials.rst>`_ as always."
msgstr ""
"覺得這裡還有甚麼遺漏？歡迎像往常一樣提交您的 `pull request <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/blob/master/community/tutorials.rst>`_ 。"

msgid "Where to start"
msgstr "從哪裡開始"

msgid ""
"The Godot video tutorials by `GDQuest <https://www.youtube.com/channel/"
"UCxboW7x0jZqFdvMdCFKTMsQ/playlists>`_ are well-regarded in the community and "
"often recommended as a gentle introduction to beginners."
msgstr ""
"`GDQuest <https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxboW7x0jZqFdvMdCFKTMsQ/"
"playlists>`_ 製作的 Godot 影片教學在社群內廣受好評，也經常被推薦給初學者作為"
"入門參考。"

msgid ""
"GDQuest's *Learn GDScript From Zero* is a free and open source interactive "
"tutorial for absolute beginners to learn to program with Godot's GDScript "
"language. It is available as a `desktop application <https://gdquest.itch.io/"
"learn-godot-gdscript>`__  or `in the browser <https://gdquest.github.io/"
"learn-gdscript>`__."
msgstr ""
"GDQuest 推出的 *Learn GDScript From Zero* 是一款免費且開源的互動式教學，專為"
"編程零基礎的新手設計，協助大家學習如何使用 Godot 的 GDScript 語言進行編程。你"
"可以把它作為 `桌面應用程式 <https://gdquest.itch.io/learn-godot-gdscript>`__ "
"來使用，也可以直接 `在瀏覽器中 <https://gdquest.github.io/learn-gdscript>`__ "
"學習。"

msgid ""
"Some tutorials mentioned below cover more advanced subjects, e.g. on 3D or "
"shaders."
msgstr "下方提及的部分教學涵蓋更進階的主題，例如 3D 或著色器。"

msgid "Video tutorials"
msgstr "影片教學"

msgid ""
"For video tutorials we recommend looking on `YouTube <https://"
"www.youtube.com/>`_. There are many great channels covering a wide array of "
"subjects."
msgstr ""
"關於影片教學，我們推薦到 `YouTube <https://www.youtube.com/>`_ 查找，平台上有"
"許多優質頻道涵蓋各種主題。"

msgid "Text tutorials"
msgstr "文字教學"

